Thera","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Arch%C3%A4ologisches_Museum_Thira_Amphore_10.jpg/960px-Arch%C3%A4ologisches_Museum_Thira_Amphore_10.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Museum of Prehistoric Thera","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":36.416497,"lo":25.432597,"d":286,"h":"We-Mo 08:30-15:00; Tu off","w":"https://www.santonet.gr/museums/prehistoric_museum.htm","wp":"en:Museum of Prehistoric Thera","ds":"The Museum of Prehistoric Thera (Greek: Μουσείο Προϊστορικής Θήρας) is located in Fira, on the island of Santorini in Greece. It was built on the site of the old Ypapanti Church which was destroyed in the 1956 Amorgos earthquake.","wpu":"Museum of Prehistoric Thera","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Pr%C3%A4historisches_Museum_Thira_01.jpg/960px-Pr%C3%A4historisches_Museum_Thira_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Aroma Suites","g":"sights","k":"hotel","la":36.41565,"lo":25.431316,"d":286,"w":"https://aromasuites.com/","ph":"+30 22860 24112","wifi":1},{"n":"Megaro Gyzi Museum","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":36.420823,"lo":25.430962,"d":325,"h":"May-Oct Mo-Sa 10:00-16:00","w":"http://gyzimegaron.gr/en/museum/","ph":"+30 22860 23077"},{"n":"ΚΤΕΛ Σαντορίνης public local bus","g":"sights","k":"information","la":36.416518,"lo":25.433628,"d":364,"ph":"+30 22860 25404","wifi":1},{"n":"Vina Katsini","g":"sights","k":"hotel","la":36.420619,"lo":25.433127,"d":403,"ph":"+30 22860 23946","wifi":1},{"n":"Volkan \"photo spot\"","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":36.416443,"lo":25.434286,"d":420},{"n":"Summer Time Villa","g":"sights","k":"hotel","la":36.418857,"lo":25.434605,"d":422,"w":"https://www.summertime-santorini.com/","wifi":1},{"n":"Mirinda Premium villa","g":"sights","k":"hotel","la":36.421116,"lo":25.433108,"d":444,"w":"https://www.ariviagroup.com/","ph":"+302286023356","wifi":1},{"n":"Fira Backpackers Place","g":"sights","k